],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008305","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1041","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[38,52,31,51,20,18],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2750","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1008305","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国天水太守。诸葛亮北伐时采用姜维的计谋使蜀军败退，后中诸葛亮离间计，怀疑姜维叛魏，使姜维无奈投蜀。最终与夏侯楙被诸葛亮所败，一同逃往羌胡。","tc":"魏國天水太守。諸葛亮北伐時采用姜維的計謀使蜀軍敗退，后中諸葛亮離間計，懷疑姜維叛魏，使姜維無奈投蜀。最終與夏侯楙被諸葛亮所敗，一同逃往羌胡。","en":"Governor of Tianshui in Wei. When Zhuge Liang launched his Northern Expedition, he adopted Jiang Wei's scheme and repelled the Shu forces. He then fell victim to Zhuge Liang's scheme of sowing discord, which made him suspect Jiang Wei of betraying Wei, leaving Jiang Wei no choice but to defect to Shu. He was ultimately defeated alongside Xiahou Mao by Zhuge Liang, and both fled to the Qiang tribes.","jp":"魏の天水太守。諸葛亮の北伐の際、姜維の計略を採用して蜀軍を敗退させたが、後に諸葛亮の離間の計にかかり、姜維の裏切りを疑って彼をやむなく蜀へ投降させた。最後は夏侯楙と共に諸葛亮に敗れ、共に羌胡へと逃亡した。","kr":"위나라의 천수태수. 제갈량이 북벌을 일으켰을 때 강유의 계책을 채택하여 촉군을 패퇴시켰으나, 이후 제갈량의 이간계에 넘어가 강유가 위나라를 배반했다고 의심하여 결국 강유가 어쩔 수 없이 촉에 투항하게 만들었다. 끝내 하후무와 함께 제갈량에게 패하여 강호로 달아났다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10209","remark":"","surname":"马","surnameTc":"馬","surnameEn":"Ma","surnameJp":"馬","surnameKr":"마","surnameOther":"","name":"遵","nameTc":"遵","nameEn":"Zun","nameJp":"遵","nameKr":"준","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"马遵","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"214","city":"CS1032","gender":"0","rule":"38","force":"52","wise